<div class="hero wrap">
  <div class="hero-top">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">Data in · documents out</p>
      <h1>Your data, <em>proofread</em> before it's printed.</h1>
      <p class="sub"><strong>Built for AI workflows.</strong> Your agent gathers the data; <code>metais</code> makes every document come out the same way, every time: checked against the package's schemas, filled into its templates, the same bytes on every platform.</p>
      <p class="sub2">A METAIS package is one <strong>.metais</strong> file: templates, a JSON Schema for every input, and a guide to what each input means. <code>metais</code> reports <strong>every problem at once</strong>, with where it is and how to fix it, and only then fills in the documents.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="dict" lang="en">
        <div class="hw">me·tais <span class="ipa">/mɛˈteɪ/</span> <i>n.</i></div>
        <p><b>meh-TAY.</b> Like Beaujolais, not like metal: the s stays silent. Multi-file Extensible Templating And Instantiation Specification.</p>
      </div>
