<!-- ================= SAFETY ================= -->
<section class="safe" id="safe" aria-labelledby="safe-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Safe with packages from strangers</p>
    <h2 class="big" id="safe-h">A package can fill in documents. Nothing else.</h2>
    <p class="lede">Templates are side-effect free. Whatever is inside a package, it:</p>
    <div class="seals">
      <div class="seal">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 86 86" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="43" cy="43" r="40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="43" cy="43" r="33" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="2 3"/><path d="M30 34 l-7 9 7 9M56 34 l7 9 -7 9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M28 60 L58 26" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        <h3>Can't run code</h3>
        <p>Nothing in a package is ever executed.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="seal">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 86 86" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="43" cy="43" r="40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="43" cy="43" r="33" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="2 3"/><path d="M31 24h17l8 8v30H31z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M24 62 L62 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        <h3>Can't read other files</h3>
        <p>Only the package itself and the inputs you give it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="seal">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 86 86" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="43" cy="43" r="40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="43" cy="43" r="33" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="2 3"/><circle cx="43" cy="43" r="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M27 43h32M43 27c-8 9-8 23 0 32M43 27c8 9 8 23 0 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M24 62 L62 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        <h3>Can't reach the network</h3>
        <p>No fetches, no phoning home.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="seal">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 86 86" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="43" cy="43" r="40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="43" cy="43" r="33" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="2 3"/><circle cx="43" cy="43" r="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M43 34v9l6 4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M24 62 L62 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        <h3>Can't see your machine</h3>
        <p>No environment variables, host name, user or clock.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="seal wide">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 86 86" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="43" cy="43" r="40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="43" cy="43" r="33" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="2 3"/><path d="M28 36h30M28 50h30" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        <div><h3>So: same inputs, same bytes</h3><p>The same package and the same data give the same bytes on macOS and Linux, amd64 and arm64. Run it a thousand times in an agent loop and the document never drifts.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="after">And before it reads any file in a package, <code>metais</code> checks the package against its digests and its security limits, so decompression bombs and the like are refused at the door. The invoice package, as <code>metais inspect</code> identifies it:</p>
    <p class="digest">METAIS 1.0, packed, sha256:af30477b6470efed759a616226659b320d16077a474f562436f3e838c53841bf</p>
  </div>
</section>

